    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense but it still feels a bit risky. like how do i know the agent is actually going to be neutral? what stops them from just, i don't know, taking the money or being biased toward the seller since they're probably the ones who hired them?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
