      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i get the legal part, but it just feels like we're giving a huge pile of cash to a total stranger to just sit on. it's like handing over a treasure chest and hoping they don't decide to just keep it for themselves or something lol. is there any way to see where the money is actually held or if there are safeguards for the actual physical security of the funds?",
